    <string name="guide_title">Floating Capsule Guide</string>
    <string name="guide_line_1">• Floating Icon Bar: one-tap Solve, Go, Stop, Path preview, Result card, Grid calibration, and tuning drawer; drag the orb to snap to either screen edge.</string>
    <string name="guide_line_2">• With Preview ON, tap Solve to preview the path first, then tap Go to swipe. With Preview OFF, tapping Go solves and swipes immediately.</string>
    <string name="guide_line_3">• Full-Board Question Orbs: automatically memorizes flash-reveal boards; enable Hold-and-Replan for stages that reveal after holding or nudging.</string>
